WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.680
I swear to God.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.720
I made one coffee joke.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.020
The Commish just couldn’t leave it alone!

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.800
Relax, Damon. This ain’t Hahvahd.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.480
Choose your name.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.900
On your game card, tap Coffee pre-order.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.750
Coffee, latte, cappuccino, macchiato.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:19.200
Hot or iced.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.370
Milk, Stevia in the Raw, even an espresso shot.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.370
Tap Send to the Commish.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.300
Come back here to change or cancel.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:31.560
Give him thirty minutes’ notice before you pahk the cah.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.920
He’s BostnMike—not Dunkin’.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.600
App already installed?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.020
The new features will be there next time you open the app.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.380
No reinstall needed.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.040
So what are ya waiting for?

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.900
Put the yellow chip on your phone.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:45.640
How d’ya like them lattes?
